text = [[NAI ...] [[CMENE ... # | (indicators & free ...)] [[joik-jek] text-1 
text-1 = [[(I [[jek | joik] [[[[stag] BO] #) ... | NIhO ... #] [[paragraphs] 
paragraphs = paragraph [[NIhO ... # paragraphs] 

We deal with each component of ''text'' as follows:

# [[NAI ...] [[CMENE ... # | (indicators & free ...)]: If present, it is removed.
# [[joik-jek]: If present, it is replaced with "co'e i joik-jek"
# [[(I [[jek | joik] [[[[stag] BO] #) ...] : If present, it is replaced with "(co'e I [[jek | joik] [[[[stag] BO] #) ..."
# [[NIhO ... #]: If present, it is removed.
# [[paragraphs]: If absent, inroduce "co'e".

With those replacements, every ''text'' is reduced to ''paragraphs''. 

For example {je i ja broda} becomes {co'e i je co'e i ja broda}.

